# FretCoach runs entirely client-side with no required environment variables.
# The variables below are placeholders for optional future integrations
# described in docs/ROADMAP.md (e.g. an opt-in LLM coaching provider or a
# server-side analysis backend). Leave this file as-is for the default,
# fully local experience.

# Example placeholder for a future opt-in LLM coaching provider.
# LLM_COACHING_API_KEY=

# Example placeholder for a future cloud sync backend (e.g. Supabase).
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
